Version 0.7.7+
	* Require Python 3.11 or later and NumPy 2.0 or later
	* Switch build system to meson-python
	* Build wheels for Linux (x86_64, aarch64), macOS and Windows
	* Fix the `tiff:YResolution` option, which was ignored (`tiff:XResolution` was used for both)
	* Fix hang and buffer over-read on truncated JPEG files
	* Raise TypeError on invalid options instead of aborting the interpreter
	* Fix out-of-bounds reads in `imread_from_blob` on malformed or truncated input
	* Fix crash when reading an empty WebP blob
	* Fix BMP reading: top-down bitmaps, BITMAPV4/V5 headers, and swapped red and blue channels in paletted images
	* Support 1-, 4- and 32-bit BMPs; 16-bit BMPs are now returned as RGB
	* Fix saving of big-endian (non-native byte order) arrays, which were written byte-swapped
	* Raise an error when saving TIFF metadata containing NUL bytes, instead of silently truncating it
	* Add an API reference to the documentation, and rewrite the docstrings

Version 0.7.6 2024-08-02 by luispedro
	* Fix loading paletted PNGs with transparency

Version 0.7.5 2023-11-22 by luispedro
	* Fix build issue (#43, patch by @carlosal1015)

Version 0.7.4 2020-04-14 by luispedro
